      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1314207848,
      "text": "Cyperus distans, also known as slender cyperus, is a species of sedge native to tropical and subtropical wetlands in sub-Saharan Africa, Asia, Madagascar, New Guinea, Australia, Latin America, the West Indies, the southeastern United States and various oceanic islands."
    },
